      "message": "Per `polygerrit-ui/app/embed/README.md`, the `embed/` directory is reserved for self-contained components that can be used independently of Gerrit (e.g. in Gitiles).\n\n`GrDiffMarkdownViewer` directly imports application domain models (`commentsModel`, `browserModel`, `userModel`) and `\u003cgr-comment-thread\u003e`. This inverts the dependency layering and prevents this component from being used outside of Gerrit.\n\nConsider moving this under `polygerrit-ui/app/elements/diff/gr-diff-markdown-viewer/` (and moving `markdown-diff-util.ts` either to `polygerrit-ui/app/utils/` or co-locating it there), or splitting it into an embeddable model-free renderer in `embed/` and a host component in `elements/diff/`.",
